data: {"id": "18f9c50cc49143cb-thinking-parallel_evidence-933", "run_id": "18f9c50cc49143cb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据采集结论\n\n### 已确认事实（支持/反驳/限定）\n\n**1. Pod 当前状态：仍然处于 ImagePullBackOff，未恢复**\n- `kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl_get_yaml` 均确认 Pod 处于 **Pending** 阶段，容器状态 `Waiting`，Reason=`ImagePullBackOff`，`Ready=False`。\n- Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 返回 `reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"`，值=1，与 describe 一致。\n- 指标 `kube_pod_status_phase` 显示 phase=Pending（值=1），phase=Running/Failed/Succeeded 均为 0。\n- 重启计数 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`=0，容器从未成功启动过。\n\n**2. 镜像拉取失败的根本原因：DNS 解析失败，镜像仓库不可达**\n- Eve", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788768329881, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

